{"text":"I'm honored not only to be the 360th commencement speaker at my alma mater, but to do so in the year Harvard University, as the oldest institution of learning in America, celebrates 375 years of preparing minds for service and leadership. Thank you for the invitation and congratulations to you, Dr. Poss, the first female president of Harvard University. It is a great pleasure to share in Harvard's distinguished and storied history. Harvard has produced presidents, prime ministers, a United Nations Secretary General, leaders in business, government, and the church.","words":[{"text":"I'm","start":0.96,"end":1.76},{"text":"honored","start":1.76,"end":2.06},{"text":"not","start":2.06,"end":3.92},{"text":"only","start":3.92,"end":4.32},{"text":"to","start":4.32,"end":4.74},{"text":"be","start":4.74,"end":5.54},{"text":"the","start":5.54,"end":5.7},{"text":"360th","start":5.7,"end":7.1},{"text":"commencement","start":7.1,"end":7.4},{"text":"speaker","start":7.4,"end":8.28},{"text":"at","start":8.28,"end":9.56},{"text":"my","start":9.56,"end":9.8},{"text":"alma","start":9.8,"end":9.98},{"text":"mater","start":9.98,"end":10.48,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":11.98,"end":12.2},{"text":"to","start":12.2,"end":12.38},{"text":"do","start":12.38,"end":12.62},{"text":"so","start":12.62,"end":12.96},{"text":"in","start":12.96,"end":13.44},{"text":"the","start":13.44,"end":13.54},{"text":"year","start":13.54,"end":13.82},{"text":"Harvard","start":13.82,"end":14.16},{"text":"University","start":14.16,"end":15.02,"punct":","},{"text":"as","start":15.24,"end":16.42},{"text":"the","start":16.42,"end":16.62},{"text":"oldest","start":16.62,"end":17.1},{"text":"institution","start":17.1,"end":17.82},{"text":"of","start":17.82,"end":18.2},{"text":"learning","start":18.2,"end":18.54},{"text":"in","start":18.54,"end":18.84},{"text":"America","start":18.84,"end":19.38,"punct":","},{"text":"celebrates","start":20.48,"end":21.2},{"text":"375","start":21.2,"end":22.44},{"text":"year